,"summary":{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1121,"mm_rank":941,"target_category_support_fraction":0.16666666666666666,"selected_image_count":3,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Shopping","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Candy Stores","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Chocolatiers & Shops","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Flowers & Gifts","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","review_id":"-SvD6LoGFnGUHuqI9DsdbA","date":"2014-11-21T08:41:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.943221926689148,"text_excerpt":"Treat yourself to a temple of chocolate indulgence. I have never seem anywhere a place offering the range of first-rate chocolates and truffles as at Blue Frog. They have some amusing accessories for chocolate enthusiasts at all addiction stages. Don't pause at the door and worry that You May Not Be Worthy, you Know you are, just sashay in and immerse yourself in the orders, surrounded by chocolate. BF stands in a row of other boutiques in a pleasant part of uptown New Orleans, so make this a destination. I have even made custom orders for unique combinations I've encountered elsewhere. When buying small boxes for others, I always get one \"Roady\" to celebrate being such a good human."},{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","review_id":"BIipR4ZQ0VKtiYnD9jmEKA","date":"2013-09-06T18:04:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9426890015602112,"text_excerpt":"Such a great shop! Whenever I passed Blue Frog, I always kind of assumed that it was just a \"do it yourself/build your own box\" type of chocolate shop. While you can pick and choose chocolates from the case, they also have an assortment of all kinds of chocolates that you can give as gifts or just enjoy yourself. My faves that I saw were the chocolate musical instruments, chocolate water meters, chocolate streetcar tokens and chocolate gators. A definite \"must\" for anyone who is visiting NOLA and wants a \"different\" kind of souvenir to bring home. They have a TON of cute gift ideas and I could never go through them all, but I will say that I thought that the chocolate gavel geared towards..."},{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","review_id":"NEZl5-dm5XOZmAm6SxgLOQ","date":"2014-11-26T02:33:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9420328140258789,"text_excerpt":"In New Orleans, there are many ways to indulge, but Blue Frog Chocolates is a must! Not only do they have the fresh chocolates in the back, but also unqiue variations of chocolates that you can give as gifts (flowers, musical instruments, streetcar tokens, ect) all around the store - and they always have new stuff. And you can't forget to check out their \"naughty chocolate\" section! I get excited seeing BFC at events too. Their chocolate covered Zapps are the best ending to my Oak St. PoBoy Fest experience!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","photo_id":"Rbs_MhZJvwTRsUM8nF_hdw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Rbs_MhZJvwTRsUM8nF_hdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9059441089630127},{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","photo_id":"NiPiBth0God3m0xvpXgJNQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NiPiBth0God3m0xvpXgJNQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8416510820388794},{"business_id":"Rqy6bGteapJSxhII3fpQtQ","photo_id":"qLJmiKNHum8oaVQVWIGbKw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qLJmiKNHum8oaVQVWIGbKw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7774465084075928}]},"notebook_case":null}
